  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation to the SIAM 2024 in Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SIAM, Salon International de l&apos;Agriculture au Maroc, is the biggest and most important international agricultural exhibition and conference in the Maghreb-region and attracts around one million visitors annually.The goal of this project is to participate with a Dutch pavilion at SIAM with 15 to 20 Dutch horticulture &amp; agro-food companies and governmental and knowledge institutes. This will create the following opportunities:&#x2022;	Business opportunities and knowledge transfer between Dutch companies and Moroccan and Maghreb companies;&#x2022;	To enhance possibilities for further cooperation; &#x2022;	To promote selected Dutch funded programmes and activities in the agriculture sector in Morocco and identify new partnerships and activities between the Netherlands and Morocco in the field of agri- and horticulture and the Dutch combi-track approach; &#x2022;	To position the Netherlands, and its companies, as the partner in sustainable, innovative, climate-smart and circular agriculture and horticulture.The SIAM takes place in Mekn&#xE8;s.</narrative>
  </description>
